Fixed both findings in `src/matrix.rs`:

- `matrix.mean` and `matrix.sum` now use compensated summation with an exact power-of-two overflow fallback, so finite results at `f64::MAX` stay finite.
- Added regression assertions for both reductions at `f64::MAX` with a three-element count and for sum cancellation.
- Updated `SPEC.md` and the phase report to match the new behavior.

All four gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test --all-targets` (2592 passed, 0 failed), and `../rbops/verify.sh phase-106`.
